[I] Easily generate well-formed, namespace-aware XML

[T] XML::Writer is a simple Perl module for writing XML documents. It takes
[T] care of constructing markup and escaping data correctly and by default
[T] performs well-formedness checks, e.g. that start and end tags match and
[T] that there is exactly one document element.

[U] https://metacpan.org/dist/XML-Writer

